# ADVANCED fallback only — prefer `grok login` → ~/.grok/auth.json.
# Copy to ~/.config/grokbot-usage/session and replace with a Bearer access token.
# NEVER commit the real file. NEVER paste the token into chat.
#
# Either form works:

Bearer eyJhbGciOi...

# — or bare token value —
# eyJhbGciOi...
